   "definition_quote": "In round $t = 1, 2, \\dots, T$, a (possibly non-oblivious) adversary selects and reveals a set $\\sA_t \\subseteq [K]$ of active arms to the learner. ... the adversary selects a (hidden) loss value $\\ell_{i,t} \\in [0,1]$. The learner pulls one active arm $i_t \\in \\sA_t$ and observes loss $\\ell_{i_t, t}$. ... R(a) = \\sum_{t=1}^T I_{a,t}(\\ell_{i_t,t}- \\ell_{a,t})."
